# This file intentionally carries no redirect rules.
#
# The profile Worker serves every navigation request from index.html through its own configuration, in
# wrangler.jsonc:  "assets": { "not_found_handling": "single-page-application" }
# so an old or shared link such as /about boots the profile instead of Cloudflare's empty-body 404.
#
# The rule that used to sit here, "/*    /index.html   200", is rejected by Cloudflare Workers while the
# assets are uploaded:
#   Invalid _redirects configuration: Infinite loop detected in this rule. This would cause a redirect
#   to strip `.html` or `/index` and end up triggering this rule again. [code: 100324]
# The rewrite to /index.html normalises to / and matches "/*" again, so the build fails. Cloudflare Pages
# accepts the rule, this Worker does not, and the wrangler.jsonc setting replaces it.
#
# Keep the file rule-free, and delete it if it is ever in the way: nothing reads it any more.